      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"maeglin123\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ac8455/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> maeglin123:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I tryed that link, but it no longer seems to be going to the post thsy has the answer to that question. Is there a new link to the answer?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The forums were moved (some time in 2012?), so any links created before then wouldn't work.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I wasn't able to easily find the original thread.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I recommend referring to Spiff's collection of rulings and clarifications.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm/files/sotm_rules_and_clarifications.pdf\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm/files/sotm_rules_and_clarifications.pdf</a></p>",
