      "raw": "[quote=\"Pydro\"]\n\n4. It is all from 1 attack though. not multiple attacks. Even if an attack does 0 damage, it would still use it up.\n\n[/quote]\n\nActually, if something does damage which ends up with a total of 0 (or less) then no damage is taken, thus it doesn&#39;t qualify as next damage (thus an attack of 0 will not remove stealth protection)\n\nHowever, irreducible damage would use up the protection, with none of the benifets of the protection.\n",
