      "raw": "[quote=\"TheJayMann\"]\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>Pydro wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">4. It is all from 1 attack though. not multiple attacks. Even if an attack does 0 damage, it would still use it up.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nActually, if something does damage which ends up with a total of 0 (or less) then no damage is taken, thus it doesn&#39;t qualify as next damage (thus an attack of 0 will not remove stealth protection)However, irreducible damage would use up the protection, with none of the benifets of the protection.\n\n[/quote]\n\nYour right. I knew there was a sitaution where you could lose everything and not have it used, just couldn;t remember and wasn&#39;t thinkning.\n",
