      "created_at": "2013-07-12T00:41:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Considering it is reduction, I would think it would go away even if the thing causing Wraith damage were somehow reduced to 0 by another means. As damage reduction and increases happen \"simultaneously\" it would end up being in order of play if anything. Considering Wraith's character card has probably been in play the longest, her damage reduction will surely kick in before any other damage reduction.</p><p>However I am not so sure about Immunity.</p>",
